    <statement><p>Without a calculator, match each of the equations below to one of the
graphs by placing the corresponding letter of the equation under the
appropriate graph.</p>
<p>A. <m>y = \sin{(t)} + 2</m></p>
<p>B. <m>y = \sin{(t+  2)}</m></p>
<p>C. <m>y = \sin{(2 t)}</m></p>
<p>D. <m>y = 2 \sin{(t)}</m></p>
